 ## API Reference
 
-The primary entry point is `Document`, which loads a `.one` file and exposes its pages as a tree
-of `Page`, `Outline`, `OutlineElement`, `RichText`, `Image`, `Table`, and `AttachedFile` nodes;
-`Document.Save()` is the sole write path, currently limited to PDF via `PdfSaveOptions`. The
+The primary entry point is `aspose.note.Document`, which loads a `.one` file and exposes its pages as a tree of nodes; `Document.Save()` writes the document to PDF. The supported public entry points are `aspose.note` and `aspose.note.saving`.
+
+The public API has 37 types.
